[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3876068931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-3876068931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":3876068931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nCB5D","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T08:19:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T08:26:36Z","body":"I'm not too sure this fix makes sense because the below lines should already be making the dock visible: \r\n```_move_dock(p_dock, slot, tab_index, p_set_current && slot->can_switch_dock());``` \r\nand\r\n```tab_container->set_current_tab(tab_index);```\r\n\r\nI feel like there is a deeper issue at play here; possibly to do with how `TabContainer` handles `set_current` different to a child changing visibility. Replacing every instance of `set_current_tab` with `dock->show()` had the same effect of resolving the issue but I'm not too sure why that makes sense.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3876068931/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3876931081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-3876931081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":3876931081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nFUYJ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T11:05:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T11:05:57Z","body":"This looks like ordering problem. For some reason the plugins active in different order depending on whether AnimationPlayer was selected or not. `make_visible()` makes the dock always become visible, so Animation takes visibility over AnimationTree if it's activated later.\r\n\r\nThis can be fixed on the animation plugins' side, by not making the Animation visible if AnimationTree is selected (though it may be tricky).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3876931081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3879334539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-3879334539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":3879334539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nOfKL","user":{"login":"KCeple77","id":52489126,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDg5MTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52489126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77","html_url":"https://github.com/KCeple77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T16:53:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T16:53:43Z","body":"Hmh, okay thanks.\r\n\r\nFrom what I see -> AnimationTree's make_visible is called, and then after it AnimationPlayer's make_visible is called. Inside AnimationPlayer's make_visible there is a line which checks if ATree is currently visible in tree, and if yes, it doesn't make the APlayer visible over it.\r\n\r\nThat fix used to work, so it seems then _move_dock or set_current_tab are not setting ATree's visibility to 1, which makes APlayer fail the check for ATree visibility, in turn making itself visible over ATree.\r\n\r\nI will dig up those 2 functions and check why its visibility not being altered properly.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3879334539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3881624312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-3881624312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":3881624312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nXOL4","user":{"login":"KCeple77","id":52489126,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDg5MTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52489126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77","html_url":"https://github.com/KCeple77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T01:29:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T01:29:40Z","body":"I have been debugging the AnimationTree code path.\r\np_dock->set_tab_index(p_tab_index, p_set_current); is not called for AnimationTree in this scenario, and the rest of the _move_dock function doesn't ever set p_dock's visibility, only the dock tab container's visibility: dock_tab_container->update_visibility();\r\n\r\nAfter adding a set_visibility line for p_dock however, it seems to work","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3881624312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4018676520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-4018676520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":4018676520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7viCMo","user":{"login":"KCeple77","id":52489126,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDg5MTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52489126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77","html_url":"https://github.com/KCeple77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T08:58:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T08:58:16Z","body":"Bump","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4018676520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020019489","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-4020019489","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":4020019489,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vnKEh","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T21:10:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T21:10:48Z","body":"I looked into the issue more and opened a PR for it here: \r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117232\r\n\r\nI mention it in the PR too, but here are some findings:\r\n\r\n>I'm not too sure this fix makes sense because the below lines should already be making the dock visible:\r\n\r\n`set_current_tab` changed the tabs visibility, but not immediately since it was deferred.\r\n\r\n> This looks like ordering problem. For some reason the plugins active in different order depending on whether AnimationPlayer was selected or not. make_visible() makes the dock always become visible, so Animation takes visibility over AnimationTree if it's activated later.\r\n\r\nThe `EditorData::get_handling_sub_editors` orders AnimationPlayer after AnimationTree so it is always shown after. Except for one case where the AnimationPlayer was visible. The AnimationPlayer doesn't get changed to because the dock manager thinks it is already visible, since the TabContainer didn't change visibility to AnimationTree yet. So only the AnimationTree gets shown in this case.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/220b0b2f74d8e089481b140c42a42992a76dd6fc/editor/docks/editor_dock_manager.cpp#L663","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020019489/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4021497539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116119#issuecomment-4021497539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116119","id":4021497539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vsy7D","user":{"login":"KCeple77","id":52489126,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDg5MTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52489126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77","html_url":"https://github.com/KCeple77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T06:40:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T06:40:19Z","body":"The ordering may be alphabetical in EditorData::get_handling_sub_editors?\r\nBut, yes, true. I will close the PR then","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4021497539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]